1991+ 7C3C 32 FA E5         ld   (air_timer), a
1992+ 7C3F 21 FB E5         ld   hl, air_deplete_rate
1993+ 7C42 BE               cp   (hl)
1994+ 7C43 38 14            jr   c, .no_deplete
1995+ 7C45
1996+ 7C45                  ; Intervallo raggiunto: azzera timer e consuma 1 pixel di aria
1997+ 7C45 AF               xor  a
1998+ 7C46 32 FA E5         ld   (air_timer), a
1999+ 7C49
2000+ 7C49 3A F9 E5         ld   a, (air_pixels)
2001+ 7C4C B7               or   a
2002+ 7C4D 28 0C            jr   z, .air_finished
2003+ 7C4F
2004+ 7C4F 3D               dec  a
2005+ 7C50 32 F9 E5         ld   (air_pixels), a
2006+ 7C53 CD 23 6A         call Gfx_UpdateAirBar
2007+ 7C56
2008+ 7C56 B7               or   a
2009+ 7C57 28 02            jr   z, .air_finished
2010+ 7C59
