 424+ 839A              CheckWillyItemCollision:
 425+ 839A C5               push bc
 426+ 839B D5               push de
 427+ 839C E5               push hl
 428+ 839D
 429+ 839D                  ; ItemLeft = Col * 8, ItemRight = ItemLeft + 7
