 666+ 849D              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 667+ 849D              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 668+ 849D              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 669+ 849D              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 670+ 849D                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
 671+ 849D                  ; Byte 2:
